'''Something of an expert myself''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid at level 350 or above without anyone dying.

==Other tasks==
{{Combat Achievements list|Tombs of Amascut: Expert Mode}}

==Trivia==
* The name of this achievement is a reference to the 2002 superhero movie ''{{WP|Spider-Man (2002 film)|Spider-Man}}'', in which the character Norman Osborn introduces himself to Peter Parker as being "something of a scientist myself."

